            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="d330-15" n="15" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve04/d330-15"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1969-76ve04">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume E–4</ref>,
                    Documents on Iran and Iraq, 1969–1972. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d163">Document 163</ref> (date of
                            correction: February 5, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the text for Document 163 was a
                        duplication of the text for Document 164. Editors added the correct text and
                        page images for Document 163.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#d188">Document 188</ref> (date of
                            correction: February 19, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the text for the second page of
                        the telegram at Document 188 was missing. Editors added the correct text and
                        page images for Document 188.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
